{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46695","headline":"咏茶十二韵 · 齐己","name":"咏茶十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百草让爲灵，功先百草成。\n甘传天下口，贵占火前名。\n出处春无雁，收时谷有莺。\n封题从泽国，贡献入秦京。\n齅觉精新极，尝知骨自轻。\n研通天柱响，摘遶蜀山明。\n赋客秋吟起，禅师昼卧惊。\n角开香满室，炉动绿凝铛。\n晚忆凉泉对，闲思异果平。\n松黄乾旋泛，云母滑随倾。\n颇贵高人寄，尤宜别匮盛。\n曾寻修事法，妙尽陆先生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}